{
  "request": "Owner play-test: \"card rewards keep auto inspecting instead of showing the (i) button above it, like before. Also, the (i) button is moved in some places. the (i) button should appear anywhere there is a card that can be selected. Also, inspect should work after pressing and holding the target.\" Decided: in combat a short hold still selects and a longer hold inspects; the deck editor is unchanged.",
